<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 10pt">December 2006 to December 2010; Endologix Corporation, a publicly
traded company (chairman of the audit committee and member of the nominating and governance committee), from November 2003 until its reorganization
