date fair value are included in Note 5 to the consolidated financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2024, which are included
in this Annual Report on Form 10-K. The grant date fair value per share of the stock options granted on January 2, 2024 to all directors
was approximately $24.15 per share.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 8pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
