<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 10pt">The changes in compensation actually paid to our PEO during such
periods as described in the pay versus performance table were largely driven by the fact that no option awards were issued in 2024 versus
2023. The changes in average compensation actually paid to our non-PEO NEOs reflect the fact that no option awards were issued in 2024
versus 2023.</P>

